// Test: WITH EVERY on a node whose path has a predicate on its last step.
// The rule context drops that predicate, so the rule fires on every FieldsPrivacy element
// of a RepeatableNode. The test is translated relative to the full path of the node, so the
// field comes out without the predicate: exists(ReasonCode).

---- STAGE 1a ----

WITH EVERY ND-PrivacyInRepeatableNode
    ASSERT BT-197(BT-00)-Text-In-Repeatable-Node is present
    AS ERROR R-EVR-001
    FOR BT-197(BT-00)-Text-In-Repeatable-Node IN 1
